    {
      "id": "129c1d816679-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "The value of \\(\\frac{2^{2 k+1}-2^k \\times 2^{k+2}}{2^k \\times 2^{k+3}-2^2 \\times 2^{2 k}}\\) is:",
      "questionHtml": "The value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{2^{2 k+1}-2^k \\times 2^{k+2}}{2^k \\times 2^{k+3}-2^2 \\times 2^{2 k}}\\)</span> is:",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{1}{2^k}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{2^k}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "2 k",
          "html": "2<sup>k</sup>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(-\\frac{1}{2}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(-\\frac{1}{2}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Using a<sup>m</sup> × a<sup>n</sup> = a<sup>m+n</sup>:</p>\n2<sup>2k+1</sup> - 2<sup>k</sup> × 2<sup>k+2</sup> = 2<sup>2k+1</sup> - 2<sup>2k+1+1</sup>, 2<sup>k</sup> × 2<sup>k+3</sup> - 2<sup>2</sup> × 2<sup>2k</sup> = 2<sup>2k+1+2</sup> - 2<sup>2k+1+1</sup>.\n\n<p>Simplify common terms:</p>\nNumerator: 2<sup>2k+1</sup>(1 - 2), Denominator: 2<sup>2k+1</sup>(4 - 2), Result: (-1)/(2) = -1/2.",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "129c1d816679-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Simplify: \\(\\sqrt[6]{4096} +\\sqrt[4]{4096}+\\sqrt[3]{4096}+ \\sqrt{4096}\\)",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Simplify:</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt[6]{4096} +\\sqrt[4]{4096}+\\sqrt[3]{4096}+ \\sqrt{4096}\\)</span></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "90",
          "html": "90"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "92",
          "html": "92"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "\\(\\sqrt{2}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{2}\\)</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Given:</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt[6]{4096} +\\sqrt[4]{4096}+\\sqrt[3]{4096}+ \\sqrt{4096}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Calculation:</span></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt[6]{4096} +\\sqrt[4]{4096}+\\sqrt[3]{4096}+ \\sqrt{4096}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt[6]{2^{12}} + \\sqrt[4]{2^{12}} + \\sqrt[3]{2^{12}} + \\sqrt{2^{12}} \\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(2^{12 \\over 6} + 2^{12 \\over 4} + 2^{12 \\over 3} + 2^{12 \\over 2} \\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(2^2 + 2^3 + 2^4 + 2^6\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 4 + 8 + 16 + 64</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 92</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">&there4; The simplified value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt[6]{4096} +\\sqrt[4]{4096}+\\sqrt[3]{4096}+ \\sqrt{4096}\\)</span> is 92.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "129c1d816679-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "Give simplified form of \\(\\rm \\frac{a^{10}\\times b^{-7} \\times c^{-4}}{a^{-5}\\times b^2\\times c^5}\\) .",
      "questionHtml": "<span style=\"\">Give simplified form of</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm \\frac{a^{10}\\times b^{-7} \\times c^{-4}}{a^{-5}\\times b^2\\times c^5}\\)</span>.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "a 15 &times; b -9 &times; c -9",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">a</span><sup><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">15</span></sup><span style=\"\"><sup>&nbsp;</sup>&times; b</span><sup><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">-9</span></sup><span style=\"\"><sup>&nbsp;</sup>&times; c</span><sup><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">-9</span></sup>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "a 15 &times; b 9 &times; c 9",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">a</span><sup><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">15</span></sup><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&times; b</span><sup><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">9</span></sup><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&times; c</span><sup><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">9</span></sup>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "a 5 &times; b 9 &times; c -9",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">a</span><sup><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">5</span></sup><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&times; b</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><sup>9</sup></span>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&times; c</span><sup>-9</sup>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "a 5 &times; b -9 &times; c -9",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">a</span><sup><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">5</span></sup><span style=\"\"><sup>&nbsp;</sup>&times; b</span><sup><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">-9</span></sup><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&times; c</span><sup><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); \">-9</span></sup>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Here, we have <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(a^{10} \\times b^{-7} \\times c^{-4}\\over a^{-5} \\times b^2 \\times c^5 \\)</span> </p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ a<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">10 -(-5)</span> × b<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">-7-2</span> × c<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">-4-5</span>  [ As t<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">n</span>/t<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">1</span> = t<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">n-1</span>]  ⇒ a<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">15</span> × b<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">-9</span> × c<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">-9 </span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
