    {
      "id": "129c1d816679-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "If \\(\\sqrt{5^x}\\) = 15625, find the value of x.",
      "questionHtml": "If <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{5^x}\\)</span> = 15625, find the value of x.&nbsp;",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "11",
          "html": "11"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "12",
          "html": "12"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "16",
          "html": "16"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "15",
          "html": "15"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{5^x}\\)</span>&nbsp;= 15625</p>\n\n<p><strong>Concept Used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>a<sup>m</sup>&nbsp;= a<sup>n</sup>, Then m = n</p>\n\n<p>25<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= 15625</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{5^x}\\)</span>&nbsp;= 15625</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (5<sup>x</sup>)<sup>1/2</sup>&nbsp;= 25<sup>3</sup></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 5<sup>x/2</sup>&nbsp;= (5<sup>2</sup>)<sup>3</sup></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 5<sup>x/2&nbsp;</sup>= 5<sup>6</sup></p>\n\n<p>According to the concept,</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x/2 = 6</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x = 12</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The value of x is 12.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "129c1d816679-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "If \\(\\left( {\\frac{{32}}{{243}}} \\right)^k = \\frac{8}{{27}}\\) , then k =________ .",
      "questionHtml": "If&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\left( {\\frac{{32}}{{243}}} \\right)^k = \\frac{8}{{27}}\\)</span>, then k =________ .",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{3}{5}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3}{5}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{5}{3}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5}{3}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{3}{2}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3}{2}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{2}{3}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{2}{3}\\)</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(32/243)</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">k</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> = 8/27 </span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ (2/3)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">5k</span> = (2/3)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span> </p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 5k = 3 ⇒ k = 3/5 </p>\n",
