      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Option(2): <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt[12]{33214}\\)</span> = (33214)<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">1/12</span> ⇒ <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt[3]{12}\\)</span> = (12)<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">1/3</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ LCM(12, 3) = 12 ⇒ (12)<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">[1/3] × 12</span> and (33214)<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">[1/12]× 12</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">I.e., (12)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">4</span> and (33214)<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">1</span>, I.e., (20736)<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">1</span> and (33214)<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">1</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Since, 33214 > 20736 ⇒ (12)<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">1/3 </span>< (33214)<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">1/12</span></p>\n",
